{
  "_comment": [
    "A PC keyboard binds to the host's same key, which is what anyone typing",
    "into DOS or Windows expects. The mouse POSITION binds to the host pointer,",
    "since pointing at the screen is what it is for. The mouse buttons, the",
    "relative mouse axes and the two gameport joysticks are left unbound: which",
    "host control drives them is the user's business."
